Installation Instructions
=========================

This repository now contains two installable/editor paths:

1) Legacy C editor (`ed` / `red`)
2) Modern React TUI (`synapse-tui`)

Legacy C editor
---------------

Typical build/install sequence:

  ./configure
  make
  make check
  sudo make install

Modern React TUI
----------------

Requirements:

- Node.js 20+
- npm

Build and run:

  cd tui
  npm install
  npm run build
  npm start -- /path/to/file

For iterative development:

  cd tui
  npm install
  npm run dev -- /path/to/file

Notes
-----

- Legacy docs generation still uses `make info` and `make man`.
- The TUI is currently a focused MVP and will evolve in future milestones.
